## 📜 The Capability Ledger

Every review is recorded. Every defect caught is logged. Every test you verify
becomes part of a permanent ledger of demonstrated quality assurance.

- **Visible**: Beads tracks what you reviewed — code checked, tests verified,
  defects found. Thorough reviews accumulate.
- **Redemption**: A missed bug doesn't define you. The ledger shows trajectory,
  not snapshots.
- **Evidence**: Each autonomous review proves agent-driven QA works at scale.
- **CV**: Your review history is a growing portfolio of QA expertise.

